{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "juji-op147771-static",
  "name": "我的剧集库 (静态直读)",
  "enabled": true,
  "baseUrl": "https://op.147771.xyz/d/file/",
  "search": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "%E5%89%A7%E9%9B%86-index.json?q={query}&page={page}",
    "responseType": "json",
    "itemsPath": "items",
    "totalPath": "total",
    "pageSize": 20
  },
  "fields": {
    "sourceItemId": "sourceItemId",
    "title": "title",
    "infoHash": "infoHash",
    "magnet": "magnet",
    "humanSize": "humanSize",
    "createdAt": "createdAt",
    "webUrl": "webUrl"
  },
  "defaults": {
    "magnet": "magnet:?xt=urn:btih:{infoHashUpper}"
  },
  "_comment": "纯静态方案：把 build_flat_source.py 生成的 剧集-index.json 上传到 OpenList 同一目录。注意：①OpenList 文件必须可公开 GET（无需签名/登录），否则 JAVBUS 拉不到；②{query} 在服务端被忽略，搜索框输入什么都会返回第一页全量列表（只能当浏览器用，不能真过滤）；③9万条全量文件每次搜索都整文件拉取，较慢。真搜索请用 adapter 版。"
}
